Act as an expert Senior Full-Stack Developer and UI/UX Designer. Build a complete, production-ready, ultra-fast, SEO-friendly consultancy website and local admin CMS for a firm named "Nakshatra Business Advisory (NBA)".

---

### 1. BRAND IDENTITY & KEY DETAILS
- Company Name: Nakshatra Business Advisory (NBA)
- Tagline: "★ Plan Today. Prosper Tomorrow. Your Trusted Partner in Financial Success."
- Core Focus: FINANCIAL PLANNING, Tax Advisory, Corporate Governance, and Business Consulting.
- Director / Leadership: Pravigya Pranav Panthi
- Location: Kathmandu, Nepal
- Architecture Style: Inspired by top consultancy platforms like Kathmandu Business Consultants (KBC) and Guardian Consulting, but with superior UI/UX, modern typography, crisp contrast, and structured grid cards.

---

### 2. SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE & TECH STACK
- Frontend: Pure HTML5, Tailwind CSS (via CDN) or modern custom CSS, and Vanilla JavaScript. Fast, zero-framework bloat, fully responsive across mobile, tablet, and desktop.
- Backend (Local Admin CMS): Node.js + Express running locally on `http://localhost:3000/admin.html`.
- Local File Handling: Uses `multer` for local file and image uploads (PDF documents, Director photos, Member headshots). Saved locally to `public/uploads/`.
- Data Storage: Single structured JSON file (`data/dynamic-content.json`) driving all dynamic sections.
- Git Automation: When changes are saved in the local admin CMS, `server.js` automatically executes terminal commands (`git add .`, `git commit -m "..."`, `git push origin main`) to push updates to GitHub.
- Hosting Compatibility: 100% static host friendly (Vercel, Netlify, or GitHub Pages). Every push triggers an instant live rebuild.
- Contact Form: Serverless form-to-email integration via Web3Forms or Formspree.

---

### 3. REQUIRED DYNAMIC SECTIONS & FEATURES (MANAGEABLE VIA CMS)

Every dynamic section must support an `enabled: true/false` toggle switch so the admin can hide/show elements without deleting data:

1. Notification Popup Modal & Document Upload:
   - Enable/Disable toggle.
   - Headline/Notice title, custom message, button label, and PDF file upload input.

2. Director & Team Members (Leadership Page / Section):
   - Add, edit, or delete members.
   - Fields: Name (e.g., Pravigya Pranav Panthi), Title (Director / Financial Advisor), Bio / Short Message, Enable/Disable switch, and Profile Image Upload (`.jpg`, `.png`, `.webp`).

3. Achievements & Metrics:
   - Add/edit/delete key company metrics (e.g., "Nrs. 1B+ Assets Under Management", "2018 Year Founded", "100+ Corporate Clients").

4. Testimonials Section:
   - Add/edit/delete client reviews (Quote, Client Name, Company / Designation).

5. Services Grid:
   - Dynamic cards for services (Title, Short Summary, Detailed Breakdown).

6. Highlighted Video Section:
   - YouTube embed URL, video title, and short description.

7. Insights & Downloadable Guides / Posts:
   - Article title, category badge, publication date, and downloadable guide URL/PDF.

---

### 4. DELIVERABLE SOURCE CODE REQUIREMENTS

Provide complete code for the following 4 primary files:

#### File 1: `data/dynamic-content.json`
Pre-populated JSON structure covering `notificationPopup`, `directorAndTeam` (with Pravigya Pranav Panthi), `achievements`, `testimonials`, `services`, `highlightedVideo`, and `posts`. All containing `enabled: true`.

#### File 2: `server.js` (Node.js Backend)
- Sets up Express, static file serving (`/uploads`), Multer storage engine for file/image uploads, JSON read/write endpoints, and `child_process` Git terminal automation (`git add .`, `git commit`, `git push`).

#### File 3: `public/admin.html` (Local CMS Dashboard)
- A clean, modern admin interface.
- Tabbed or card layout with inputs for all sections.
- File upload inputs for Team Member Images and Notice PDFs.
- Enable/Disable checkboxes for every item/section.
- Save button that uploads files, updates JSON, and logs Git deployment status in real-time.

#### File 4: `index.html` (Public Website Frontend)
- Semantic HTML5 structure with OpenGraph meta tags for SEO.
- Modern header with logo (NBA) and sticky navigation.
- Hero Section featuring the tagline "Plan Today. Prosper Tomorrow."
- Leadership / Director Section dynamically rendering team photos and bios.
- Services grid, achievements stat-bar, video breakdown embed, and testimonials carousel/grid.
- Popup Modal script that checks `notificationPopup.enabled` on load.
- Contact form wired to Web3Forms.